@doc smysl/0.1 { id: v/anaphor, granularity: { profile: default } }

@claim c/anaphor { status: speculative }
~ This is what caused the regression in the eu-west shard.

The connection pool saturated under the new concurrency limit introduced by the
4.2 rollout, pushing acquisition wait from two milliseconds to three hundred and
ten over the same seven day window.
